---
// EthicsBiasLaundering: generated bilingual SVG figure (site tokens only, polygon arrowheads, no fixed ids).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 330;
---
<figure class="ebl">
  <div class="ebl-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Four steps: history that favored one group, a model that learns the pattern, a score such as risk_score = 84, and a caseworker who sees only the number.">
      <text x="20" y="24" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>How a skewed history becomes a clean-looking score</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cách lịch sử lệch thành điểm số trông sạch sẽ</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="46" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>Four steps from old decisions to the number a caseworker sees.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bốn bước từ quyết định cũ tới con số người xét duyệt nhìn thấy.</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="86" width="170" height="60" rx="8" class="box hot" />
      <DiagramIcon name="file" x={44} y={116} size={24} />
      <text x="66" y="121" class="bh red"><tspan data-lang-en>1. History</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1. Lịch sử</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 190 116 L 245.0 116.0" /><polygon points="250,116 243.7,119.0 243.7,113.0" /></g>
      <rect x="250" y="86" width="170" height="60" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="model" x={274} y={116} size={24} />
      <text x="296" y="121" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>2. Model</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2. Mô hình</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 420 116 L 475.0 116.0" /><polygon points="480,116 473.7,119.0 473.7,113.0" /></g>
      <rect x="480" y="86" width="170" height="60" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={504} y={116} size={24} />
      <text x="526" y="121" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>3. Score</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3. Điểm số</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 650 116 L 705.0 116.0" /><polygon points="710,116 703.7,119.0 703.7,113.0" /></g>
      <rect x="710" y="86" width="170" height="60" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="user" x={734} y={116} size={24} />
      <text x="756" y="121" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>4. Caseworker</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>4. Người xét</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="172" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Past choices favored</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Quyết định cũ ưu ái</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="188" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>one group</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một nhóm</tspan></text>
      <text x="250" y="172" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Learns the pattern and</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Học theo khuôn mẫu rồi</tspan></text>
      <text x="250" y="188" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>copies it, faster</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lặp lại, nhanh hơn</tspan></text>
      <text x="480" y="172" class="bh mono"><tspan data-lang-en>risk_score = 84</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>risk_score = 84</tspan></text>
      <text x="480" y="188" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Looks exact and neutral</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Trông chính xác, trung lập</tspan></text>
      <text x="710" y="172" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>Sees a number, not</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ thấy một con số,</tspan></text>
      <text x="710" y="188" class=""><tspan data-lang-en>the history behind it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không thấy lịch sử</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="236" width="860" height="54" rx="8" class="box dash" />
      <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={52} y={263} size={26} />
      <text x="82" y="259" class="bh red"><tspan data-lang-en>The skew is still inside the score</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Độ lệch vẫn nằm trong điểm số</tspan></text>
      <text x="82" y="278" class="muted"><tspan data-lang-en>Nothing on the screen shows where it came from.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Trên màn hình không có gì cho biết nó từ đâu tới.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The prejudice never leaves the pipeline, it only changes shape. By step 4 it looks like a neutral number nobody can argue with.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Định kiến không rời khỏi hệ thống, chỉ đổi dạng. Tới bước 4 nó trông như một con số trung lập, không ai cãi được.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ebl { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ebl-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ebl svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ebl text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ebl .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ebl .sub { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ebl .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ebl .box.hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .ebl .box.fix { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .ebl .box.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .ebl .bh { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ebl .bh.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .ebl .muted { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ebl .red { fill: var(--red); }
  .ebl .redtxt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ebl .num { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ebl .strike { text-decoration: line-through; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ebl .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); }
  .ebl .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .ebl .bar { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .ebl .arrow path { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ebl .arrow polygon { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ebl .arrow.red path { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .ebl .arrow.red polygon { fill: var(--red); }
  .ebl .arrow.gold path { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .ebl .arrow.gold polygon { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .ebl .arrow.dash path { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .ebl figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
